<br class="ltx_break">Per-size configuration (max pieces, difficulty thresholds), 
<br class="ltx_break">Target number of puzzles per size/mode <math id="alg2.l1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="T" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>T</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">T</annotation></semantics></math>

